1. BEETROOT FACE PACK FOR CLEAR SKIN
You can make a natural face pack by mixing beetroot juice with a spoon of curd or honey. Apply it to your face and leave it for 15 minutes before washing it off. This helps reduce acne scars, dark spots, and dryness.

2. BEETROOT SCRUB TO REMOVE DEAD SKIN
Mix beetroot juice with oatmeal or sugar to make a gentle scrub. Rubbing this on your face helps remove dead skin cells, unclog pores, and improve blood circulation, leaving the skin soft and smooth.
